    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19862" root="سعو and سعى" body-key="s">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اسعاهُ</span></b>  signifies <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَعَلَهُ يَسْعَى</span>, (K, TA,) i. e.
<i>He made him to earn,</i> or <i>gain.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اسعى عَلَى صَدَقَاتِهِمْ</span> <i>He employed a collector of
their poor-rates.</i> (TA.) [See also 10.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْعَوْا بِهِ</span> <i>They gave him,</i> or <i>performed</i> or <i>accomplished for him, what he desired,</i> or <i>sought,</i> or
<i>needed.</i> (Sgh, K, TA.)

